Lay a pressure triggered trap that explodes in a radius 2 cloud of searing flames when triggered, stunning foes with the blast ([41, 48, 54, 59, 63 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] fire damage per turn) for 3 turns.

The deflagration persists in the area for 5 turns, burning foes for [61, 73, 81, 89, 95 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] fire damage each turn.

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
